# Agentic Visual Grounding & Perception (`agentic-visual-perception`)

The `agentic-visual-perception` skill empowers autonomous AI agents to interact with graphical interfaces, inspect high-resolution desktop and game canvases, ground natural language instructions into precise screen coordinates, and perform multi-scale visual verification.

---

## 1. Agentic Perception Architecture

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|               High-Resolution Canvas / Display Capture                 |
|                   (Full HD, 2K, 4K, 8K, Retina Displays)               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                    |
            +-----------------------+-----------------------+
            |                                               |
            v                                               v
+-------------------------------+               +------------------------+
|    Slicing Aided Hyper        |               |   Visual Grounding     |
|      Inference (SAHI)         |               |     Resolution         |
| Overlapping grid slices for   |               | NL Query -> Bounding   |
| microscopic icons/buttons     |               | Box & Click Centroid   |
+-------------------------------+               +------------------------+
            |                                               |
            +-----------------------+-----------------------+
                                    |
                                    v
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                     Verification & State Tracking                      |
