## 3. CLI Helper Tool (`agent_visual_grounding.py`)

Located at `config/skills/agentic-visual-perception/scripts/agent_visual_grounding.py`.

### Commands
```bash
# 1. Tile high-resolution 4K canvas using SAHI grid
python3 config/skills/agentic-visual-perception/scripts/agent_visual_grounding.py \
  slice --image desktop_4k.png --slice-w 640 --slice-h 640 --overlap 0.20 --output slices.json

# 2. Ground natural language target to spatial coordinates
python3 config/skills/agentic-visual-perception/scripts/agent_visual_grounding.py \
  ground --image screen.png --query "save changes button" --output target.json

# 3. Crop high-resolution ROI for verification
python3 config/skills/agentic-visual-perception/scripts/agent_visual_grounding.py \
  zoom-crop --image screen.png --center-x 960 --center-y 107 --zoom 2.5 --output roi.png

# 4. Compute visual diff between consecutive action frames
python3 config/skills/agentic-visual-perception/scripts/agent_visual_grounding.py \
  diff --frame-a before_click.png --frame-b after_click.png --threshold 0.05
```
